 "summary": "ZH is a small disconnectable wire-to-board connector system on 1.5 mm pitch: SZH crimp contacts on AWG #32 to #26 wire, ZHR receptacle housings of 2 to 13 circuits, and shrouded headers in through-hole and surface-mount forms. Each contact is rated 1.0 A (AWG #26) at 50 V, from -25 to +85 ˚C. S6B-ZR-SM4A-TF(LF)(SN) is the six-circuit side-entry (right-angle) SMT header of the SM4 type, held down by a solder tab at each end.",
